add("NewParents-1x0y5kq", None, "new_mother", "regression_4_months", "tried_failed", ["app_tracking", "short_naps", "wake_windows"], "I have huckleberry and have been trying to do 4/5 naps a day for 5 hours of daytime sleep total. Getting him to fall asleep is so rough.", "16-week-old screams on entering the dark nursery; mother returns to work in a month.")
add("NewParents-1x0y5kq", None, "new_mother", "regression_4_months", "fear", ["daycare_naps", "sleep_training_values"], "Our pediatrician said not to sleep train until 5 months and I feel generally uncomfortable about sleep training in general, but I go back to work in a month and he will be at a mix of daycare and nanny share and it makes me sick to think he will get no sleep while there all day.", "Return to work forcing the sleep question.")
add("NewParents-1x0y5kq", "peotue5", "new_mother", "regression_4_months", "belief", ["app_tracking", "information_overload"], "2.5 hours is encouraging though I kept reading 5 hours and have been so stressed", "A commenter's lower daytime-sleep figure relieves her after chasing a target.")
add("NewParents-1x0y5kq", "per4zkl", "new_mother", "regression_4_months", "belief", ["app_tracking"], "I wasn’t using the app before though and had a chronically overtired baby who was cranky all the time. It feels like a lose lose", "Defends the tracking app after commenters suggest dropping it.")
add("NewParents-1x0y5kq", "per5ajw", "new_mother", "regression_4_months", "others_said", ["conflicting_advice", "guilt"], "I feel so terrible for him and just in general like a bad mom since everyone around me has a million suggestions and seems so baffled nothing is working.", "Replying to another parent with a screaming baby.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1x0z7ue", None, "new_mother", "newborn_0_8_weeks", "tried_failed", ["price_value", "contact_naps"], "Literally, she hates it and I hate it too.", "First-time mum's 9-day-old will not sleep in the bedside crib; she blames the thin mattress.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1x0z7ue", None, "new_mother", "newborn_0_8_weeks", "price_signal", ["price_value"], "It feels such a waste of money as now it is useful only to store things in it😮‍💨", "Bedside crib bought before birth now holds clutter.")
add("sleeptrain-1x1v40b", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "success_story", ["gentle_method", "regression_4_month", "feeding_to_sleep"], "6 month old, Day 7 of Sleep Wave. The difference feels unreal, and... I'm really trying to make it not sound like marketing.", "Post title; free method found on the subreddit after brief Ferber stopped working.")
add("sleeptrain-1x1v40b", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "pain", ["night_wakings", "feeding_to_sleep", "regression_4_month"], "The longest stretch reduced to 8 hours, then 7, then 5, then 3 by end of September.", "Sleep unravelled from about four months; parent had logged it all in a tracking app.")
add("sleeptrain-1x1v40b", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "success_story", ["gentle_method", "transition_to_cot"], "Before, we used to feed her until she was completely asleep and transfer her like we were defusing a bomb.", "What changed by day 7: transfers no longer matter.")
add("sleeptrain-1x1v40b", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "success_story", ["gentle_method", "night_wakings"], "Whole \"wake → feed → crib and asleep\" thing takes about **15-20 mins**.", "Night feeds used to take one to three hours; they did not night-wean.")
add("sleeptrain-1x1v40b", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "success_story", ["gentle_method"], "So I'm absolutely not claiming that this will last forever, or that this is how long it takes, or she's perfectly sleep trained now.", "Day 7 was rougher again; parent hedges the success.")
add("sleeptrain-1x1v40b", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "advice_given", ["gentle_method", "free_advice"], "I found out about Sleep Wave from this sub, from many other parents going through similar journeys and struggles.", "Source of the method that worked: other parents, not a paid plan.")
add("sleeptrain-1x1v40b", "pf422dc", "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "success_story", ["night_wakings"], "You can handle not getting 8 hour sleeps yourself anymore it if only involves 1 brief 15-20 minute interruption that doesn't involve a whole involved routine.", "Why the change matters even though the baby still wakes.")
add("sleeptrain-1x260fh", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "trigger_moment", ["cry_it_out", "cosleeping", "maternal_exhaustion"], "I am tired, sick, & 23 weeks pregnant. Where the hell do I even start to get back to where we were?", "16-month-old's sleep collapsed after illnesses and ear surgery; post title says one more attempt before hiring a consultant.")
add("sleeptrain-1x260fh", "ph41ssu", "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "success_story", ["sleep_consultant", "ferber"], "I am working with a sleep consultant this time around. I am doing a modified version of Ferber. We are on day 4 now & last night was better.", "Six days after posting, the parent hired a consultant after recovery from surgery.")
add("beyondthebump-1x28ee6", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_9_12_months", "question", ["early_waking", "price_value"], "He sleeps from 7pm - 5am (which I know is a good sleep) but I wonder if a better nappy would help him stay asleep longer?", "Weighing branded night nappies against a budget brand.")
add("sleeptrain-1x2akqs", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "failure_story", ["sleep_consultant", "consistency_failure", "night_weaning"], "Used a sleep consultant and 12 months and night weaned at 13.5 months", "15-month-old still has awful split nights after a consultant plan.")
add("sleeptrain-1x2akqs", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "pain", ["night_wakings", "consistency_failure"], "The split nights are getting worse and worse and I’ve caved a few times and given a bottle just to try and get some sleep.", "After a consultant and night weaning.")
add("NewParents-1x2fcw7", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_2_4_months", "objection", ["swaddle_transition", "sleepwear", "price_value"], "I have multiple 3-6 month halo sleep sack swaddles so I prefer to use those as we transition rather than buying the love to dream transition swaddle.", "Avoiding another branded sleepwear purchase for the swaddle transition.")
add("NewParents-1x2fpzu", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_2_4_months", "objection", ["transition_to_cot", "price_value", "room_sharing"], "it seems wasteful to buy a mini crib for our room to use for such a short amount of time.", "11-week-old outgrowing the bassinet; parent not ready for own room.")
add("sleeptrain-1x2mskb", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_9_12_months", "question", ["course_purchase", "sleep_training_values"], "Can I sleep train him or is it too late? I have been following the 3/3/4 wake windows with 2 naps.", "9-month-old breastfed and waking 3-4 times; planning a paid course method.")
add("sleeptrain-1x2mskb", "pf3zmri", "parent_unspecified", "baby_9_12_months", "question", ["cry_it_out", "sleep_training_values"], "Has anyone done it successfully at 9 months? How much time will he cry the first night?", "Before starting.")
add("sleeptrain-1x2qwr4", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "question", ["sleep_consultant", "ferber", "price_value"], "Should sleep training have been more successful by now?", "Consultant engaged at four months for hourly wakes; bedtime solved, two feeds and early wakes remain at 6.5 months.")
add("sleeptrain-1x2qwr4", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "success_story", ["sleep_consultant", "ferber"], "One big win is that we can put him down awake at bedtime, and he’ll fall asleep independently within 5–10 minutes without any fussing or crying.", "Result of consultant-led modified Ferber.")
add("sleeptrain-1x2qwr4", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "belief", ["sleep_consultant", "wake_windows", "conflicting_advice"], "I’ve seen lots of advice online suggesting that the last wake window should be the longest of the day. However, our sleep consultant recommended keeping it to around 1 hour 30/ 1 hour 45 hours for now", "Paid advice contradicts free online advice.")
add("sleeptrain-1x2qwr4", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "pain", ["early_waking"], "I think these wake ups are the hardest for me particularly as I know I’m not going to intervene and I’m awake in those early hours when my own sleep pressure is also low", "5am babbling before going back down.")
add("sleeptrain-1x2qwr4", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "regret", ["sleep_consultant", "price_value"], "I know sleep training worked absolute miracles for some people, and I think I went into it expecting that we’d eventually get to a point where he was sleeping much longer stretches consistently.", "Expectation gap after a paid consultant.")
add("sleeptrain-1x2qwr4", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "pain", ["comparison_other_babies"], "the women in my mothers’ group seem to fall into two extremes: their babies either sleep through the night or are terrible sleepers. There doesn’t seem to be much in between!", "Few mum friends to calibrate expectations.")
add("sleeptrain-1x2qwr4", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "desire", ["sleep_consultant", "price_value"], "sometimes it feels like we’ve put in so much effort to establish good sleep habits, and I expected the payoff to be a little bigger.", "Closing line of a long post asking what's realistic.")
add("NewParents-1x2wzz2", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_2_4_months", "pain", ["wake_windows", "information_overload", "schedule_rigidity"], "Every post on Instagram was giving me the “ideal nap schedule” and it always felt so unrealistic, but that didn’t stop the accounts from stressing me out further that I was doing something so so wrong for my baby.", "12-week-old; parent dropped a tracking app and wake windows.")
add("NewParents-1x2wzz2", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_2_4_months", "success_story", ["free_advice", "schedule_rigidity"], "So I texted my friend who is on her third baby and her advice was basically to just go with the flow. For the past few days I have been treating my firstborn like she is a thirdborn", "What turned it: a friend's advice, not a schedule.")
add("NewParents-1x2wzz2", "pf8vyd1", "parent_unspecified", "baby_2_4_months", "tried_failed", ["app_tracking"], "It also felt like every time I hit “start” on the sleep button in Huckleberry, it was a jinx and she’d wake right up.", "Reply in a thread about dropping tracking apps.")
add("NewParents-1x2wzz2", "pf8x81r", "parent_unspecified", "baby_2_4_months", "belief", ["app_tracking", "information_overload"], "I was staring at an app to tell me about my baby rather than looking at my baby to figure out what was going on.", "After deleting the apps and stopping searching.")
add("sleeptrain-1x3h9dx", None, "new_mother", "baby_9_12_months", "question", ["sleep_consultant", "price_value", "partner_disagreement"], "I’m seriously considering hiring a sleep consultant. Has anyone done this? Was it worth it?", "Post title: Sleep coach worth it? 11.5-month-old nursed to sleep; husband against cry-it-out.")
add("sleeptrain-1x3h9dx", None, "new_mother", "baby_9_12_months", "others_said", ["partner_disagreement", "cry_it_out", "feeding_to_sleep"], "My husband doesn’t want to do the cry-it-out method, so I usually nurse her to sleep, which is fine until she wakes up in the middle of the night!", "Former nanny who never struggled with other children's sleep.")
add("sleeptrain-1x3h9dx", None, "new_mother", "baby_9_12_months", "pain", ["comparison_other_babies"], "I’ve nannied so many kids and never had trouble getting them to sleep, except my own!", "Former nanny considering a consultant.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1x3ir5j", None, "experienced_mother", "looking_back", "price_signal", ["smart_bassinet", "price_value", "maternal_exhaustion"], "I can get a second hand snoo £450-500. A huge amount but believe me when I say that there is no price I would not have paid in that first year for more sleep", "Pregnant-again mother whose first baby did not sleep; a friend credited a smart bassinet.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1x3ir5j", None, "experienced_mother", "looking_back", "pain", ["maternal_exhaustion"], "But I didn’t sleep more than 2 consecutive hours for 12 months and it broke me", "Looking back at the first baby's year.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1x3ir5j", None, "experienced_mother", "looking_back", "others_said", ["smart_bassinet", "comparison_other_babies"], "My friends baby born similar time just…. Slept. She said it was because of the snoo", "Why she is considering the purchase.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1x3ir5j", "pfbmq8v", "experienced_mother", "looking_back", "price_signal", ["smart_bassinet", "price_value"], "So renting is looking about £125/m for my location, over 6 months would definitely be cheaper to buy it & then resell if we liked it.", "Comparing rent versus second-hand purchase.")
add("toddlers-1x3ose5", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_24_36_months", "question", ["sleep_consultant", "night_wakings", "cosleeping"], "What could I do differently? Should we consider hiring a sleep consultant? Like I'm SOOOO tired of this.", "25-month-old on a floor bed in the parents' room, still waking multiple times.")
add("toddlers-1x3ose5", "pgdsc8w", "parent_unspecified", "toddler_24_36_months", "others_said", ["partner_disagreement", "sleep_training_values"], "I wish my partner would agree to it but he is so against it", "Reply about sleep training.")
add("sleeptrain-1x3pzvm", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "failure_story", ["course_purchase", "twins"], "However, we didn’t see the pattern many people talk about where they had a handful of hard nights and then things snapped into place. Our babies have had more of a slow burn response.", "Twins trained with a paid course at 5 months; improved but still crying a month on.")
add("sleeptrain-1x3pzvm", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "pain", ["early_waking", "course_purchase"], "both of my babies are struggling to make it to 6am. They usually wake up around 5 and we struggle with trying to do the “pop ins” for the last hour of the morning.", "A month after starting the course.")
add("sleeptrain-1x49d74", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "success_story", ["sleep_consultant", "regression_4_month", "pacifier"], "I was so sleep-deprived that I started working with a sleep coach, who felt he was having too much daytime sleep.", "Early 4-month regression, waking every 45-60 minutes; night sleep improved massively.")
add("sleeptrain-1x49d74", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "objection", ["sleep_consultant", "wake_windows", "personalization"], "Honestly, it sometimes feels cruel trying so hard to keep him awake when he seems tired and is struggling. My instinct is to let him sleep if he needs it, rather than force him to fit a schedule.", "Coach refused a fourth nap for a 16-week-old.")
add("sleeptrain-1x49d74", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "others_said", ["sleep_consultant", "conflicting_advice"], "The sleep coach doesn’t believe in overtiredness, which I’m finding difficult to reconcile with what I’m seeing.", "Parent conflicted between the coach's plan and the baby's cues.")
add("sleeptrain-1x49d74", "pfi0gyj", "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "others_said", ["sleep_consultant", "personalization"], "I’ve asked her and she’s said she’s not sure what to suggest other than trying to extend the wake window before that last nap.", "Follow-up on asking the coach.")
